# BuildKit picks this over the repo-root .dockerignore (which excludes
# everything) for builds using docker/Dockerfile.  Allowlist: only what the
# image copies.
*
!modemgui/requirements.txt
!modemgui/docker/
!modemgui/Makefile
!modemgui/modemgui/
!modemgui/tests/
!tests/c/
!tests/OFDM/c/
!tests/CSS/c/
**/__pycache__
**/*.so
**/*.dylib
